---
---
<section class="founder section section--tight">
  <div class="container founder__wrap">
    <p class="founder__copy">
      Lanzada en 2017, Unlimited Code <span class="serif">reimaginó</span> el desarrollo a la medida
      con su modelo de suscripción. Hasta hoy, la opera enteramente Emilia González — sin contratar
      desarrolladores extra ni subcontratar el trabajo, enfocada en entregar calidad de primer nivel
      a un número limitado de clientes a la vez.
    </p>
    <div class="founder__sign">
      <button type="button" class="founder__avatar" data-confetti aria-label="Lánzame confeti">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="76" height="76" rx="22" fill="var(--ink)"/><circle cx="30" cy="34" r="3.4" fill="#fff"/><circle cx="50" cy="34" r="3.4" fill="#fff"/><path d="M26 48c3.6 4.8 8.4 7 14 7s10.4-2.2 14-7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      </button>
      <span class="founder__by">
        <strong>Emilia González</strong>
        <span>Fundadora</span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder__wrap { max-width: 820px; }
  .founder__copy {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 1.1rem + 1.5vw, 2.05rem);
    line-height: 1.28;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    max-width: 32ch;
  }
  .founder__copy .serif { color: var(--ink); }

  .founder__sign { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 4vh, 2.75rem); }
  .founder__avatar { flex-shrink: 0; width: 46px; height: 46px; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; line-height: 0; }
  .founder__avatar svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.16)); }
  .founder__by { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.25; }
  .founder__by a { text-decoration: none; }
  .founder__by strong { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--ink); transition: color 0.18s var(--ease-out); }
  .founder__by span { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .founder__by a:hover strong { color: var(--accent); }

  /* interactive feedback — the brand mark gives a small happy hop, then bursts confetti on click */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .founder__avatar svg { transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out); }
    .founder__avatar:hover svg { transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(-6deg); }
    .founder__avatar:active svg { transform: scale(0.92); }
  }
</style>
